    "bio": "a Representative from Oregon; born in Williston, Williams County, N. Dak., April 4, 1939; graduated from Salem Academy, Salem, Ore., 1957; B.S., Oregon State University, Corvallis, 1961; teacher, 1961-1975; West Linn, Oreg., city council, 1977-1980; member of the Oregon state house of representatives, 1980-1986; Clackamas County, Oreg., board of commissioners, 1987-1996; elected as a Democrat to the One Hundred Fifth and to the five succeeding Congresses (January 3, 1997-January 3, 2009); was not a candidate for reelection to the One Hundred Eleventh Congress in 2008.",
